    "summary": "UK Standard Visitor rules under Appendix V of the Immigration Rules. Up to 6 months for tourism, family visits, business, short study. Visa required, ETA (\u00c2\u00a310), or visa-free depending on nationality. No fixed financial minimum published.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "GOV.UK \u00e2\u20ac\u201d Visit the UK as a Standard Visitor",
        "url": "https://www.gov.uk/standard-visitor"
      },
      {
        "title": "Check if you need a UK visa",
        "url": "https://www.gov.uk/check-uk-visa"
      }
    ]
  },
  "source_notes": [
    "Visa fee: \u00c2\u00a3135 for up to 6 months. Apply online at gov.uk. Earliest: 3 months before travel.",
    "ETA (\u00c2\u00a310, 2-year validity): for EU/EEA, USA, Canada, Australia, Japan, and other visa-free nationals.",
    "No fixed financial minimum. Must show ability to support yourself + return journey.",
    "Passport valid for entire stay. No minimum beyond departure date.",
    "NHS not free for visitors \u00e2\u20ac\u201d charged 150% of tariff. Travel insurance strongly recommended."
  ],
